{"id": 265, "date": "2026-10-01T15:41:57", "date_gmt": "2026-10-01T15:41:57", "guid": {"rendered": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/bariatric-surgery/", "raw": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/bariatric-surgery/"}, "modified": "2026-10-18T08:05:19", "modified_gmt": "2026-10-18T08:05:19", "password": "", "slug": "bariatric-surgery", "status": "publish", "type": "page", "link": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/bariatric-surgery/", "title": {"raw": "Bariatric Surgery", "rendered": "Bariatric Surgery"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Bariatric (obesity) surgery can lead to substantial, lasting weight loss and improve weight-related health problems and quality of life. The right procedure depends on your health, your weight and your goals, and is chosen together with your surgeon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1077,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-ai-m877.jpg\" alt=\"Waist measurement during a weight-loss consultation\" class=\"wp-image-1077\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A supportive, respectful approach</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Deciding on weight-loss surgery is a big step, and you do not have to take it alone. We take your health, your dignity and your well-being seriously and work with experienced teams who offer evidence-based treatment in a supportive, judgement-free setting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Weight-loss treatments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1425,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-u3xgdju3xgdju3xg-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Anatomical models of a normal stomach and a gastric sleeve\" class=\"wp-image-1425\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gastric Sleeve</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sleeve gastrectomy reduces the size of the stomach, which limits food intake and leads to significant, sustainable weight loss. One of the most widely performed weight-loss operations today.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1426,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-u13q2uu13q2uu13q1-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Anatomical models of a normal stomach and a gastric bypass\" class=\"wp-image-1426\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gastric Bypass</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most common form, the Roux-en-Y gastric bypass, reduces food intake and limits calorie absorption by changing the route of the digestive tract. A proven option for long-term weight loss.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1427,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-7e8qdq7e8qdq7e8q-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Anatomical stomach models for gastric balloon treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1427\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gastric Balloon</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A non-surgical option: a soft, saline-filled balloon in the stomach creates a feeling of fullness and helps to reduce food intake. Depending on the system, it stays for several months. On average it leads to a weight loss of about 10% of body weight and is often a first step on the weight-loss journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact us and tell us what you are interested in. We advise you and refer you to the right specialist in T\u00fcrkiye for an online consultation. Medical documents go directly to the doctor, only on request.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your weight-loss treatment with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->", "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">Bariatric (obesity) surgery can lead to substantial, lasting weight loss and improve weight-related health problems and quality of life. The right procedure depends on your health, your weight and your goals, and is chosen together with your surgeon.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-ai-m877.jpg\" alt=\"Waist measurement during a weight-loss consultation\" class=\"wp-image-1077\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-ai-m877.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-ai-m877-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-ai-m877-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-ai-m877-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-ai-m877-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A supportive, respectful approach</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Deciding on weight-loss surgery is a big step, and you do not have to take it alone. We take your health, your dignity and your well-being seriously and work with experienced teams who offer evidence-based treatment in a supportive, judgement-free setting.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Weight-loss treatments</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-u3xgdju3xgdju3xg-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Anatomical models of a normal stomach and a gastric sleeve\" class=\"wp-image-1425\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-u3xgdju3xgdju3xg-opt.jpg 1600w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-u3xgdju3xgdju3xg-opt-300x164.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-u3xgdju3xgdju3xg-opt-1024x559.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-u3xgdju3xgdju3xg-opt-768x419.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-u3xgdju3xgdju3xg-opt-1536x838.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-u3xgdju3xgdju3xg-opt-18x10.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gastric Sleeve</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sleeve gastrectomy reduces the size of the stomach, which limits food intake and leads to significant, sustainable weight loss. One of the most widely performed weight-loss operations today.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-u13q2uu13q2uu13q1-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Anatomical models of a normal stomach and a gastric bypass\" class=\"wp-image-1426\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-